    "notes": [
      "Approximate totals through Aug 31, 2026 combine the previously reported Jan 1-Jun 8 baseline with non-overlapping Jun 9-Aug 31 TikTok Shop records for both accounts. Figures are rounded; prior GMV/units are treated as continuous with current attributed GMV/items.",
      "New screenshots display GMT-8. The earlier baseline timezone was not recorded; this extension assumes compatible date boundaries. The old combined and per-account rounded GMV displays differ by $1,000.",
      "Product views through Aug 31 use the owner-approved presentation of new product impressions as views. About 147M combines the earlier rounded 105M+ display with about 42M from the non-overlapping Jun 9-Aug 31 records. This is an approximate business presentation, not a verified platform metric rename. The differently rounded account baseline displays sum to 105.8M.",
      "All-time video views add only 38,953,750 Video Views from Jun 9-Aug 31 TikTok Studio exports to the previously published 416M+ video-view baseline for both profiles through Jun 8. The rounded baseline makes About 455M an estimate; product impressions are excluded. No lifetime units or product-view baseline is available.",
      "Liposomal Glutathione combines complete April-August monthly records for both creator profiles; Testosterone+ combines complete May-August monthly records for both profiles. These product-only periods have no earlier baseline added. Rounded dashboard displays make their sums approximate. Product examples use the period printed on each card and remain subsets of overall attributed GMV.",
      "Selected-period video views, profile views, likes, comments and shares are exact sums of the reported Jan 1-Aug 31, 2026 TikTok Studio export integers, including signed comment adjustments. Both profiles have all 243 daily rows. CSV timezone is not stated. Cross-account totals are events, not deduplicated people. Period likes remain separate from dated public-profile total likes and followers.",
      "Dollar values ending in + are clean rounded presentations of source-based estimates, not exact totals or certified raw-platform minimums. In particular, the rounded Astaxanthin display uses the central source-display sum; its rounding uncertainty can cross the displayed threshold. Visible estimate labels and period qualifications remain. Existing lifetime GMV retains its separately disclosed historical-baseline assumption. Package prices are exact and unchanged.",
      "NMN and Magnesium show documented partial subtotals from the historical Jan 1-Jun 8 baseline plus only the matched, non-overlapping records available through Aug 31. Their unit subtotals use the same included records. Missing account/month cells remain unknown, not zero, and these cards do not claim complete Jan-Aug results. Source definitions, prior timezone assumptions and potential reporting adjustments remain limitations."
    ],
    "productTotalsAreSubsets": true
  },
